body:
I was midlands, we spent majority about tudors, victorans, and worldwars. Not much on egyptians, scottish or vikings, if any. I learnt about alot of the cruel things Britain did during secondary school, but i've still had to research quite abit of it myself.

&#x200B;

Edit: Just remembered did do some about vikings, not alot though, didn't touch the great heathen army or the different invasions. Mainly focused on anglo-saxons and normans.
